StationManagmentSystem v1.5a
c BelaOkuma 2017-2026

!! IMPORTANT: update SMS and PIM together !!
SMS v1.5 only works with PIM v1.2: the data goes over the network now.
An old PIM v1.1 sends no data to SMS v1.5.

 ### developed with MDK ###

new in update 1.5a:
 - the SMS on a construct find each other over the network (IGC): one is master, the others are standby
   (a PB on a large grid is preferred); buttons on a standby SMS are passed to the master
 - the PIM data comes over the network; PIM gone: the PIM values are cleared after ~10 s
 - terminal menus: new syntax @site/@link/@action/@body/@end (the old one still works),
   errors are shown in the title line and listed in the CustomData
 - menu action "PIM:ctrl_ref" goes to PIM; "Control Refinerys/Assemblers" is done by PIM now

